## 🕶️ 0x01 — THE MINDSET (Fundamentals)

| Principle | What it means |
|---|---|
| **Attack Surface Thinking** | Every subdomain, employee, PDF metadata field, and S3 bucket is a door. |
| **OSINT Cycle** | Plan → Collect → Process → Analyze → Disseminate → Repeat |
| **Correlation > Collection** | Raw data is noise. Linking username → email → breach → real name is the skill. |
| **Diminishing Returns** | Know when to stop digging on one lead and pivot. |
| **Chain of Custody** | Screenshot + timestamp + archive everything. Data disappears. |
| **The 3 Whys** | Who owns this? Why does it exist? Why is it exposed? |

