## 🕵️ 0x04 — PASSIVE RECON WORKFLOW

```
[1] WHOIS + RDAP lookup ─────────► registrant, nameservers, creation date
[2] crt.sh / cert transparency ──► subdomain harvest via SSL certs
[3] DNSdumpster + SecurityTrails► historical DNS, mail servers, ASN
[4] Google/Bing/Yandex dorking ──► indexed files, panels, leaked docs
[5] Shodan/Censys ────────────────► exposed services, banners, no direct contact
[6] LinkedIn/GitHub enum ────────► org structure, tech stack, tribal knowledge
[7] Breach DB correlation ───────► HIBP, Dehashed → credential exposure
[8] Wayback Machine ──────────────► deleted/changed content, old endpoints
```
**Rule of passive recon:** if your traffic ever reaches the target's server directly, it's not passive anymore.

