## ⚔️ 0x05 — ACTIVE RECON WORKFLOW

```
[1] Nmap (top ports → full scan) ─► open ports, service versions, OS guess
[2] httpx + Wappalyzer ───────────► live host confirmation, tech stack
[3] Gobuster/ffuf directory brute─► hidden endpoints, admin panels
[4] Nuclei template scan ─────────► known CVEs & misconfig detection
[5] Nikto/WhatWeb ─────────────────► web server specific weaknesses
[6] Screenshot sweep (Aquatone) ──► visual triage of large host lists
[7] Manual banner grabbing ───────► confirm/verify automated findings
```
**Rule of active recon:** every packet you send is potentially logged. Scope + authorization first, always.

